Subject: [PATCH 6/6] rusticc: web UI addons (addons_path)

The [server] option addons_path (one root per line) serves web UI addon
files at /addons/* from the first root that has them (no-cache) and
/addons/manifest.json, the panels found as <root>/panels/<name>/panel.js
in any root (first root wins a name, sorted): what the Mainsail panel
extender's loader reads. Port of the Moonraker patch 'Serve web UI addon
panels' (OpenCentauri/cosmos#298, abd18ce); paths with anything but
normal segments are a 404.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017xQsBSvb6emYLfnWCbF3jA
